Calibration, transparent Dialog hit geometry and action-token handling are
adapted from DialogMenu and its entity-hit prototype, by palkane and
DialogMenu contributors. Those files have been modified for this independent
entity-rendered engine. The original Apache-2.0 license and Commons Clause
condition are retained in LICENSE.

src/main/resources/font-widths.bin.gz lists only the glyph advances of the
Minecraft 26.3 default font (Mojang bitmaps and GNU Unifont), measured through
the client's own glyph providers; it contains no glyph images.

The core shader files under src/main/resources/resourcepack/assets/minecraft/
are modified copies of Minecraft 26.3 shaders. Minecraft is a trademark of
Mojang AB; this project is not affiliated with Mojang or Microsoft.
